{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q36", "domain": "health", "question": "请问命主在一岁前被诊断出那一种疾病？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "首先分析命主八字：日主乙木生于丑月，天寒地冻，地支丑戌辰三土成势，土重金旺。天干透丙、辛、庚，官杀混杂，乙木无强根，仅时支辰中一点微根。日主极弱，金木交战，木主肝、目、筋骨，受克严重。年干丙火为太阳，本可暖局，却与辛金相合，失其明暖；时柱庚金合日主乙木，乙庚相合，犹如刀金拘束柔木，木气屈曲，正合斗鸡眼（内斜视）之象，为目睛被牵拉、偏斜之征。一岁前尚在月柱辛丑运，流年丁亥，丁火透而受亥水克合，眼神更暗弱，亥水为印为保护，被土回克，先天发育不足，眼疾必显。其余心脏有孔（丙辛合）、肺炎（金旺）、地中海贫血（土重水弱）虽有一定命理征象，但乙庚合目、木被金伤之象最为直接突出，且斗鸡眼属先天筋脉拘挛，与命理相印。故断为弱视。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q36", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P4_G4\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P4_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 144746, "response_id": "7b94c733-4431-4668-86e5-529f6008809a", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 217, "completion_tokens": 6502, "total_tokens": 6719, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 6218}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 89}}
