{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q38", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主的身材外貌如何？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "日主乙木，生于丑月，土旺当令。八字地支辰戌丑土全，土重木折，乙木衰弱无强根又乏水印生扶，故身材偏矮。土主敦厚，肌肉较实，水木不旺故不高，土多埋金，官杀受制，相貌不显威严而显平和。丙火伤官透出暖局，但丙辛合而牵绊，火势不炎，故非高瘦白皙，反而因土重而微胖圆脸。综合判断为偏矮微胖之象。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q38", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P4_G4\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P4_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 23676, "response_id": "c86f2fd6-be25-459c-8c30-0a37aeef3dc1", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 252, "completion_tokens": 1098, "total_tokens": 1350, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 966}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 124}}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q39", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2016年，家中发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n命主八字为丙戌、辛丑、乙丑、庚辰。日主乙木，生于丑月，土旺木凋，全局财官强而日主弱。年干丙火伤官暖局为用，然丙火坐戌土，根气有损。\n\n- **大运推演**：命主为阳年男命，顺排大运，约1岁4个月起运。2016年命主9岁，正处于第一步大运壬寅（1.36岁-11.36岁）。\n- **流年分析**：2016年为丙申年。天干丙火伤官与原局年干丙火伏吟，并与月干辛金七杀相合，丙辛合化水，印星得化，但用神丙火被合走，代表祖辈或父亲之象受损。地支申金正官冲克大运地支寅木劫财，形成金木交战，寅申为驿马之冲，主突发血光、奔波。寅木亦为丙火之偏印（甲木）的禄根，偏印可代表祖母；同时年柱为祖上宫位，年干伤官有“祖母早亡”之象。\n- **应事判断**：\n  - **A选项“父亲破产”**：财星为土，大运寅木劫财本应夺财，但流年申金冲去寅木，劫财受制，反护财星，故破产可能性低。\n  - **C选项“父亲严重车祸”**：若以偏财为父，财星己土藏于丑中，流年申金泄土，为劳碌而非血光；若以年干丙火为父，丙火被合病，但金木交战不在父星，应在木根，故非典型父车祸象。\n  - **D选项“父母离异”**：父母宫辛金被丙火合化为水，水为印，主家庭稳定、感情融洽，离异可能性极低。\n  - **B选项“婆婆因急病去世”**：年干丙火伤官，男命伤官可指祖母。丙火伏吟且被合化水而熄灭，地支寅木（偏印甲木之根，亦为祖母之象）被申金冲克拔根，祖上宫位动荡。合冲并见，急病之象显著，应祖母（婆婆）去世。\n\n### 最终答案\nB", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q39", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P4_G4\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P4_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 150222, "response_id": "fd225398-989b-4cfe-bd4e-d2a1921c10d9", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 227, "completion_tokens": 7649, "total_tokens": 7876, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 7108}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 9